AlgebraicGeometry/LieAlgebra.lean
---------------------------------
New file (d13a8ab), line numbers as of 2026-10-12 (commit c4f93e5).
Defines the identity point e G, the Lie algebra Lie G = Dual (m/m²) of a
group scheme G over K, stalkEnd / cotangentEnd, and the representation of
End (mk G) on Lie G. No sorries left in this file.
[x] lie_algebra_represenation : End (mk G) →+* Module.End _ (Lie G)   (l.605)
