      cotangentEnd_one/_mul/_zero; map_add' via cotangentEnd_add.
[x] cotangentEnd_add                                                 (l.571)
      cotangentEnd (f + g) = cotangentEnd f + cotangentEnd g, i.e. the
      differential of μ at (e, e) is addition. Done (c4f93e5).
[ ] Cleanup: fix the typos in the names lie_algebra_repsentation' /
